---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Travel Guide | Chillax Creek"
  description="Things to do near Chillax Creek in Blue Ridge, Georgia — hiking, dining, wineries, fishing, and more."
>
  <section class="home-sec1" style="padding-top: 60px;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-lg-12">
          <h6 class="red-heading">Explore Blue Ridge</h6>
          <h2>Travel Guide</h2>
          <p>
            Chillax Creek is just 20 minutes from downtown Blue Ridge — close enough for a quick
            run for groceries or a sit-down dinner, far enough that you&rsquo;ll fall asleep to the
            creek. Here&rsquo;s a starter list of what to do nearby.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-sec4">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 mb-4">
          <h4 style="color: #B40000; font-weight: 600;">Outdoors</h4>
          <ul style="padding-left: 20px;">
            <li>Blue Ridge Scenic Railway — vintage train ride along the Toccoa River</li>
            <li>Mercier Orchards — pick-your-own apples, cider, and a great farm market</li>
            <li>Toccoa River Swinging Bridge — short hike to one of the longest swinging bridges east of the Mississippi</li>
            <li>Aska Adventure Area — mountain biking and hiking trails 10 minutes from the cabin</li>
            <li>Lake Blue Ridge — kayaking, paddleboarding, and lakeside swimming</li>
            <li>Long Creek Falls — easy waterfall hike off the Appalachian Trail</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 mb-4">
          <h4 style="color: #B40000; font-weight: 600;">Fishing</h4>
          <ul style="padding-left: 20px;">
            <li>The creek behind the cabin has minnows — fun for kids, not for keepers</li>
            <li>McCaysville access point (20 min) is the closest top-rated trout fishing spot</li>
            <li>You&rsquo;ll need both a Georgia fishing license and a trout stamp ($10 each)</li>
            <li>Both are available through the Outdoors GA app (good for a full year)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 mb-4">
          <h4 style="color: #B40000; font-weight: 600;">Food & Drink</h4>
          <ul style="padding-left: 20px;">
            <li>Harvest on Main — upscale farm-to-table in downtown Blue Ridge</li>
            <li>The Boat Dock Restaurant — lakeside dining at Lake Blue Ridge</li>
            <li>Black Sheep — laid-back gastropub favorite</li>
            <li>Mercier Orchards Hard Cider Tasting Room</li>
            <li>Grumpy Old Men Brewing — local craft beer</li>
            <li>Serenberry Vineyards — small-batch winery 20 minutes out</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 mb-4">
          <h4 style="color: #B40000; font-weight: 600;">Shopping & Town</h4>
          <ul style="padding-left: 20px;">
            <li>Downtown Blue Ridge — boutique shops, art galleries, and weekend events</li>
            <li>Out of the Blue Gallery — local art</li>
            <li>Blue Ridge Olive Oil Company — tastings and pairings</li>
            <li>The Cook&rsquo;s Cottage — kitchen goods and local foods</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 mb-4">
          <h4 style="color: #B40000; font-weight: 600;">Family-Friendly</h4>
          <ul style="padding-left: 20px;">
            <li>Old Toccoa Farm — golf and dining (Oscar from our reviews loved it!)</li>
            <li>Tank Town USA — drive a real tank or excavator</li>
            <li>Expedition: Bigfoot — the Sasquatch Museum (more fun than it sounds)</li>
            <li>Mountain Adventure Ziplines</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 mb-4">
          <h4 style="color: #B40000; font-weight: 600;">Practical</h4>
          <ul style="padding-left: 20px;">
            <li>Closest grocery: Ingles in Blue Ridge (20 min)</li>
            <li>Closest gas station: 5 minutes from the cabin</li>
            <li>Free Level 2 EV charger on-site (ChargePoint, J1772 — Tesla adapter required)</li>
            <li>Cell service: AT&amp;T and Verizon both work; T-Mobile spotty</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-lg-12">
          <p style="margin-top: 30px; font-style: italic;">
            We update this guide based on guest feedback. If you discovered something great during
            your stay, <a href="/contact-us/">let us know</a> and we&rsquo;ll add it.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
